@startuml
title ioScope Logical Class View Overview With Responsibilities
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 10
}
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

rectangle "Bootstrap and CLI\nioScopeShell, ioPipelineCli,\nioLegacyFtdiCli, ioFileComparator\n--\nEntry points and verification helpers." as bootstrap
rectangle "Qt MVC\nioQtScopeWindow, ioOscilloscopeController,\nioOscilloscopeModel, ioOscilloscopeView\n--\nUI coordination and render flow." as mvc
rectangle "Signal Flow\nioFilterPipeline, ioWaveformGenerator,\nioSignalSource family\n--\nSample processing and source selection." as signal
rectangle "Live Acquisition\nioLiveOscilloscopeSession,\nioLiveSampleHistory,\nioTappedReadableByteStream\n--\nLive sampling and tee history capture." as live
rectangle "FTDI Streams and Session\nioFtdiSession, ioFtdiByteStream,\nioFtdiOutputByteStream, ioFtdiDevice\n--\nDriver-facing stream and adapter layer." as streams
rectangle "Transfer Pipeline\nioPipelineController, ioDataBuffer,\nioUsbReadController, ioUsbWriteController\n--\nRequired threaded producer-consumer path." as pipeline
rectangle "Legacy Operations\nioBuffer, ioBaseIoOperation,\nioRead, ioWrite\n--\nOlder compatibility-only FTDI path." as legacy

bootstrap --> mvc
bootstrap --> pipeline
bootstrap --> streams
mvc --> signal
mvc --> live
signal --> streams
live --> pipeline
pipeline --> streams
legacy --> streams

note bottom of mvc
The readable detail set is split so each diagram is
presentation-sized and professor-readable.
Use the companion files:
- io_scope_logical_class_readable_mvc.puml
- io_scope_logical_class_readable_signal_flow.puml
- io_scope_logical_class_readable_ftdi_streams.puml
- io_scope_logical_class_readable_transfer_pipeline.puml
end note
@enduml
